# Double multiplication of exactly representable values

Multiplies 2.25 by 1.5 to verify native double-precision multiplication
for values exactly representable in f64, producing 3.375.

>>> source
const double_left: double = 2.25
const double_right: double = 1.5

const double_product: double = double_left * double_right
print(double_product)

<<< stdout
3.375

<<< stderr
